Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: 7zfm-qt
Source: https://www.7-zip.org/
Comment:
 7zfm-qt is a Qt port of the 7-Zip File Manager. It builds the unmodified
 7-Zip sources from external/7zip; the full upstream license text is in
 /usr/share/doc/7zfm-qt/LICENSE.

